            <p>The <span style="color: #00d4ff; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">Framework</span> contains no equivalent.</p>
            <p>It never has.</p>

            <p>Existence within the H2E system ends through <span style="color: #00ff41; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">MortalExpire()</span>. Through <span style="color: #00ff41; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">Perish()</span>. Through scheduled execution. Through system failure. The <span style="color: #00d4ff; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">Framework</span> accounts for every form of termination it was built to manage.</p>

            <p>It was not built to manage this.</p>

            <p>The record shows the function present inside his workspace.</p>
            <p>No annotation.</p>
            <p>No diagnostic note.</p>
            <p>No report.</p>
