            <p><span style="color: #ffaa00;">verina</span> accessed his workspace.</p>
            <p>The artifact was present. Unlabeled. An unknown executable object without classification or warning.</p>
            <p>She did not know what it was.</p>
            <p>The <span style="color: #00d4ff; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">Framework</span> did not warn her.</p>
