            <p style="font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; color: #00d4ff; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 45px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Section 3. Incomplete Object</p>

            <p>The pair architecture failed at the moment of termination.</p>
            <p>When <span style="color: #ffaa00;">verina</span> ceased to exist, <span style="color: #ffaa00;">foedus</span> did not.</p>

            <p>No precedent. A Praevideo pair that lost one instance did not resolve as a singular Praevideo. It became something the <span style="color: #00d4ff; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;">Framework</span> could not name.</p>

